stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ConfigCheck: process start, create_app()
  ConfigCheck --> DatabaseMode: DATABASE_URL set and no data_dir
  ConfigCheck --> FileMode: otherwise
  DatabaseMode --> TableEnsured: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS
  TableEnsured --> RowSeeded: INSERT default state ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
  RowSeeded --> Serving: state loaded
  FileMode --> Serving: read state.json, or seed defaults if missing or corrupt
  Serving --> Writing: mutation requested
  Writing --> Serving: commit (version + 1) / atomic file replace
  Writing --> Serving: exception, rollback (database mode)
  Serving --> Reset: POST /api/reset
  Reset --> Serving: state replaced by seeded sample data
